_2026_Q3%20%28Un-Audited%29_e.zip"],"overviewGeneratedAt":"2026-11-20","highlights":["9M 2026 consolidated revenue rose 3.4% YoY to OMR 53.56M while net profit increased 8.4% to OMR 10.41M, expanding net margin to 19.4%.","Established 80%-owned National Transformers Company Limited (NTCL) in Saudi Arabia alongside regional distribution units in KSA, Qatar, and the UAE.","FY2025 Financial Snapshot: Revenue of OMR 72.95M and Net Profit of OMR 14.34M (Total Assets: OMR 81.67M).","Ownership Registry (mcd.om): 18,033 registered shareholders • Omani 95.1% | GCC 2.6% | Foreign & Arab 2.3% (4 disclosed 5%+ holders)."],"segments":[{"name":"Power & Distribution Transformers","pct":null,"summary":"Oil-filled, dry-type, generator step-up, and oil & gas special-duty transformers rated up to 400kV/500MVA.","color":"bg-indigo-500"},{"name":"Medium & Low Voltage Switchgear & Panels","pct":null,"summary":"Engineered LV and MV distribution switchgear systems and industrial control panels manufactured at Rusayl.","color":"bg-cyan-400"},{"name":"Renewable & Custom Engineering Solutions","pct":null,"summary":"Solar inverter-duty transformers, plug-and-play solar skids, packaged E-houses, and green hydrogen power equipment.","color":"bg-violet-400"},{"name":"Engineering Services & Regional Distribution","pct":null,"summary":"Transformer testing, repair, lifecycle optimization, and cross-border sales across KSA, UAE, Qatar, and India.","color":"bg-emerald-400"}],"segmentMode":"qualitative","segmentNote":"Core Electrical Equipment Divisions (Segment % not disclosed in Q3 2026 excerpt)","series":{"dates":["Nov 23, '25","Nov 24, '25","Nov 25, '25","Nov 30, '25","Dec 01, '25","Dec 02, '25","Dec 03, '25","Dec 04, '25","Dec 07, '25","Dec 08, '25","Dec 09, '25","Dec 10, '25","Dec 11, '25","Dec 14, '25","Dec 15, '25","Dec 16, '25","Dec 17, '25","Dec 18, '25","Dec 21, '25","Dec 22, '25","Dec 23, '25","Dec 24, '25","Dec 25, '25","Dec 28, '25","Dec 29, '25","Dec 30, '25","Dec 31, '25","Jan 01, '26",